1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 15=

8
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,920
(My heart was gouged out.)

9
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,659
(How am I still alive?)

10
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,159
(Remember the pouch from me.)

11
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,640
(Keep it safe.)

12
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:22,900
It can save your life in a crisis.

13
00:01:39,127 --> 00:01:42,301
(Head 3 miles east within half an hour,
or you will surely die)

14
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,560
Dong,

15
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,000
I'll listen to you.

16
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:19,439
I have walked 3 miles east.

17
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:24,159
Dong, you won't let me die here, right?

18
00:02:32,819 --> 00:02:33,819
I'm so dizzy.

19
00:02:33,819 --> 00:02:35,780
Didn't you already reach
the Nascent Soul stage?

20
00:02:36,139 --> 00:02:37,139
Why still so weak?

21
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,060
(Teleportation?)

22
00:02:39,659 --> 00:02:42,199
(Only True Immortals
can master such a divine skill.)

23
00:02:42,699 --> 00:02:43,699
(How can he do it?)

24
00:02:44,259 --> 00:02:46,800
(Could it be another ancient art?)

25
00:02:47,740 --> 00:02:48,740
(I must obtain it.)

26
00:02:49,219 --> 00:02:50,219
(With teleportation,)

27
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,599
(not even a Divine Transformation
could be my equal.)

28
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,400
What are you thinking?

29
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,439
Nothing.

30
00:02:56,659 --> 00:02:59,240
Master, it was
my first time teleporting.

31
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,280
Want to learn?

32
00:03:03,139 --> 00:03:04,139
I'll teach you.

33
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:05,860
You'd really teach me?

34
00:03:06,259 --> 00:03:07,300
It's nothing.

35
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,900
But let's
finish our business here first.

36
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,300
It's Ergou!

37
00:03:23,780 --> 00:03:24,860
His heart is gone.

38
00:03:25,819 --> 00:03:26,819
He's still alive.

39
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,280
He can be saved.

40
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:30,900
His heart is gone. How can we save him?

41
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:34,120
We just give him a new heart.

42
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,639
Where can we find a heart?

43
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:45,939
You're putting a pig's heart in him?

44
00:03:45,939 --> 00:03:47,080
You don't understand.

45
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:50,800
This pig was born
blessed by celestial fortune,

46
00:03:51,939 --> 00:03:53,199
known as the Pig of Fortune.

47
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,219
With this heart,

48
00:03:55,539 --> 00:03:57,080
Ergou will be the Son of Fortune,

49
00:03:57,819 --> 00:03:58,860
shielded by the Dao.

50
00:04:28,759 --> 00:04:29,759
It's done.

51
00:04:30,660 --> 00:04:31,660
Reborn from ruin,

52
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,120
his fortune is forged.

53
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,540
(Ergou and I are blood brothers.)

54
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,579
(I'm also protected by this fortune.)

55
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:40,399
(Chaos veils the heavens.)

56
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,360
(I'm at the Golden Immortal stage.)

57
00:04:42,819 --> 00:04:45,319
(That wretched Destined Divine Maiden
won't sense a thing.)

58
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:47,279
(The heavenly fortune has shifted.)

59
00:04:51,899 --> 00:04:53,939
The heavenly fortune has shifted?

60
00:04:56,899 --> 00:04:58,000
You wretched man.

61
00:04:58,720 --> 00:05:00,199
You made one critical mistake.

62
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:02,759
With the shift in heavenly fortune,

63
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:05,939
the empire's fate
will change accordingly.

64
00:05:06,579 --> 00:05:08,100
As long as I find the Emperor Star,

65
00:05:08,579 --> 00:05:11,019
I can trace the clues and find you.

66
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:16,560
(Then, I can unleash my aura freely.)

67
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:22,600
Haven't you always wanted
to know my cultivation realm?

68
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,319
See for yourself.

69
00:05:36,819 --> 00:05:37,819
Divine Transformation...

70
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,360
Void Refinement...

71
00:05:45,180 --> 00:05:46,240
Body Integration?

72
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:49,279
The aura of Master Body Integration?

73
00:05:51,379 --> 00:05:53,759
No, it's still climbing.

74
00:05:55,819 --> 00:05:57,540
An actual Mahayana grandmaster!

75
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,579
Three Flowers gathered?

76
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,839
Five Qi converged?

77
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:05,160
This is the phenomenon
of a True Immortal!

78
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,779
He's a True Immortal.

79
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,680
My master

80
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:12,779
is a True Immortal?

81
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:22,019
All right. Don't make a fuss.

82
00:06:23,019 --> 00:06:24,240
Just do your job as my maid,

83
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:27,560
and you might ascend
to the Immortal Realm one day.

84
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,220
Remember to take Ergou home.

85
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:37,959
Oh, my! What on earth is his origin?

86
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:42,759
I actually
thought of killing him before.

87
00:06:43,660 --> 00:06:44,860
It's scary to think about it.

88
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:48,439
I should just be a good maid.

89
00:06:48,899 --> 00:06:50,560
Being a maid for someone like him,

90
00:06:50,899 --> 00:06:53,459
I wouldn't even trade it
to lead the Zixia Sect.

91
00:06:55,759 --> 00:06:56,939
Enlightened in a pig farm...

92
00:06:57,879 --> 00:07:00,600
Master is truly unmatched
throughout history.

93
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,480
Why stop?

94
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:27,279
Zhao Ergou, you're still alive?

95
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:45,639
Lin Weiyu, I just want
to ask you one thing.

96
00:07:47,220 --> 00:07:51,019
Did you ever have
any genuine feelings for me?

97
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,420
Genuine feelings?

98
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:54,920
Of course, I did.

99
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:57,639
I genuinely wanted your heart.

100
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:02,319
Ergou, do you see now?

101
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:06,600
So this is the woman
you gave your heart and soul to.

102
00:08:10,819 --> 00:08:12,480
You were lucky enough to escape,

103
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,040
yet didn't cherish it

104
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,040
and dared to come cause trouble.

105
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,620
You're truly asking for it.

106
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,639
For a filthy peasant like you,

107
00:08:23,139 --> 00:08:27,600
giving your heart to me
is the blessing of a lifetime!

108
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,959
Who knew you were so tough,

109
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:31,459
not getting eaten by wild dogs,

110
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:34,000
and even had the nerve
to come here to die?

111
00:08:34,460 --> 00:08:36,200
Look at yourself in the mirror.

112
00:08:36,779 --> 00:08:38,000
Some backwater hick

113
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:39,620
with delusions of grandeur.

114
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:42,320
I'm the magistrate's daughter,

115
00:08:42,419 --> 00:08:43,419
high above the rest.

116
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:45,139
You think you're worthy of me?

117
00:08:45,740 --> 00:08:49,100
I only wanted your rare Pure Heart.

118
00:08:54,059 --> 00:08:55,700
You two scoundrels

119
00:08:56,419 --> 00:08:58,419
are worse than beasts!

120
00:08:58,639 --> 00:08:59,639
Insolent!

121
00:08:59,980 --> 00:09:01,980
Someone! Kill him!

122
00:09:20,656 --> 00:09:24,247
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

123
00:09:24,247 --> 00:09:27,034
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

124
00:09:27,610 --> 00:09:29,772
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

125
00:09:29,772 --> 00:09:32,618
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

126
00:09:32,618 --> 00:09:35,896
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

127
00:09:35,896 --> 00:09:37,530
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

128
00:09:37,530 --> 00:09:39,594
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

129
00:09:39,594 --> 00:09:41,130
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

130
00:09:41,130 --> 00:09:43,912
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

131
00:09:44,361 --> 00:09:46,266
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

132
00:09:46,266 --> 00:09:52,297
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

133
00:09:52,879 --> 00:09:56,762
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

134
00:09:56,762 --> 00:09:59,987
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

135
00:10:00,499 --> 00:10:03,098
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

136
00:10:03,098 --> 00:10:08,226
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

137
00:10:08,226 --> 00:10:11,754
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

138
00:10:11,754 --> 00:10:15,462
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

139
00:10:15,462 --> 00:10:17,354
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

140
00:10:17,354 --> 00:10:19,431
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

141
00:10:19,431 --> 00:10:21,962
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

142
00:10:21,962 --> 00:10:25,999
♪You met the most precious person♪

143
00:10:27,667 --> 00:10:29,530
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

144
00:10:29,530 --> 00:10:32,049
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

145
00:10:32,049 --> 00:10:33,498
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

146
00:10:33,498 --> 00:10:35,800
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

147
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,770
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

148
00:10:37,770 --> 00:10:42,180
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

149
00:10:42,180 --> 00:10:43,722
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

150
00:10:43,722 --> 00:10:45,632
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

151
00:10:45,632 --> 00:10:48,906
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

152
00:10:48,906 --> 00:10:52,227
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

153
00:10:52,227 --> 00:10:53,962
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

154
00:10:53,962 --> 00:10:58,586
♪Just catch your breath first♪

155
00:10:58,586 --> 00:11:02,336
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

156
00:11:02,336 --> 00:11:05,714
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

157
00:11:06,088 --> 00:11:08,058
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

158
00:11:08,058 --> 00:11:13,805
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

159
00:11:13,805 --> 00:11:17,321
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

160
00:11:17,321 --> 00:11:18,890
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

161
00:11:18,890 --> 00:11:21,200
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

162
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,938
♪From laughter to devotion♪

163
00:11:22,938 --> 00:11:24,994
♪From falling to innocence♪

164
00:11:24,994 --> 00:11:26,842
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

165
00:11:26,842 --> 00:11:33,512
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
